<title>USA: Oceaneering sees higher demand.</title>
<headline>Oceaneering sees higher demand.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oceaneering Interational Inc said on Thursday it believes it is in the early stages of of a long term increase in demand for its services and product lines.</p>
<p>Oceaneering provides services and equipment for customers who operate in marine, space and other harsh environments.</p>
<p>Last month, Oceaneering said it would buy back up to three million shares.</p>
<p>Oceaneering said the recent trading price of the company's shares is undervalued, given its prospects.</p>
